#NEXUS

[ turner2012a_fig5: Slanted cladogram of eight avialan groups, read by eye; fully resolved and pectinate. The skeletal drawings are not encoded. 8 tips, fully resolved. Sample 7 case (census 2, seed 20261241). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=8;
    TAXLABELS
        Archaeopteryx
        Confuciusornis
        Enantiornithes
        Patagopteryx
        Ichthyornis
        Hesperornithiformes
        Paleognathae
        Neognathae
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE turner2012a_fig5 = [&R] (Archaeopteryx,(Confuciusornis,(Enantiornithes,(Patagopteryx,(Ichthyornis,(Hesperornithiformes,(Paleognathae,Neognathae)))))));
END;
